设 $\boldsymbol{A}=\left(\begin{array}{ccc}
1 & -1 & -1 \\
-1 & 1 & 1 \\
0 & -4 & -2
\end{array}\right), \quad \boldsymbol \xi_{1}=\left(\begin{array}{c}
-1 \\1 \\-2\end{array}\right)$

(1) 求满足 $\boldsymbol{A} \boldsymbol{\xi}_{2}=\boldsymbol{\xi}_{1}, \boldsymbol A^{2} \boldsymbol{\xi}_{3}=\boldsymbol{\xi}_{1}$ 的所有向量 $\boldsymbol{\xi}_{2}, \boldsymbol{\xi}_{3}$;

(2) 对 (1) 中的任意向量 $\boldsymbol\xi_{2}, \boldsymbol\xi_{3}$, 证明 $\boldsymbol\xi_{1}, \boldsymbol\xi_{2}, \boldsymbol\xi_{3}$ 线性无关
